<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<paragraphs xml:id="par-eigen-methodology" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Eigenscribe Methodology</title>

    <p>
      The :logo: <em>Eigenscribe methodology</em> is an evolving framework for organizing and refining technical
      understanding. It emphasizes transparency, reproducibility, and responsible reasoning, principles that have become
      increasingly important in the dawn of the AI era. Its general approach is to make assumptions, inferential steps,
      and <term>epistemic</term> boundaries visible so that conclusions can be critically examined and independently
      sanity-checked. Importantly, rather than requiring that all ideas originate from fully reduced foundations, this
      methodology is designed to allow exploratory and heuristic reasoning while encouraging progressive refinement
      toward more formal and reproducible structures.
    </p>

</paragraphs>
